WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:00.520
The author of <i>No Longer Human</i>,
Dazai Osamu, said he was a poor socializer.

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.140
<b>Host
Sakai Masato
The author of </b>

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:03.230
The author of <i>No Longer Human</i>,
Dazai Osamu, said he was a poor socializer.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.110
A poor socializer

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.230
There was one instance.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.860
It happened when Ibuse Masuji,
a writer Dazai saw as his mentor,

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.400
<b>Ibuse Masuji</b>

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.780
invited him to his home.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.280
He waited and waited, but Dazai didn't come.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.330
As Ibuse went out to see what had happened,

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.000
he saw Dazai wandering around, trying to find the right opportunity to enter the house.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.380
<b>Photo: Shigeru Tamura</b>

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.500
And there was another instance.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.130
Dazai once invited his junior over to design his home's power outlets.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:38.180
He managed to invite him, but he had no idea what he would say when the junior got there.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:43.810
While waiting for the junior, Dazai became heavily intoxicated after drinking alone.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.900
Dazai was truly poor at socializing with people.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.780
Why was he afraid of them?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:53.190
The masterpieces are blue.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.280
The
masterpieces
are blue

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.700
Here's the third episode of <i>No Longer Human</i>.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.980
Mom!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.610
You're home late today.

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.150
Sorry!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.150
Horiki is such a slow worker.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.620
I've been waiting for him to finish.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.080
I see.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:51.130
The murder of a Japanese monk in Shanghai has triggered conflicts between China and Japan.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:57.380
The government has decided to dispatch
destroyers to protect the Japanese residents.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.210
You don't have to do anything.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:35.500
But I must...

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.640
Daddy, you're good at drawing!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.770
So I'm "Daddy" now, huh?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.520
That's why I told 'em off.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.730
You had every right to.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.650
Your father's very handsome.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.860
Is he taking a break from work?

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.570
Yup! That's why he's always with me!

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.460
So this is what living feels like...

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.870
They are worthless.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.880
But Father, I drew my true self!

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.960
Who would want to see your true self?

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.380
But this is true art...

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.680
How do you plan on living by
drawing unprofitable pictures?

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:12.560
People who can't make a living during their adulthood are no longer human!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.070
What's wrong?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.530
I want to earn money.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.740
You don't have to do that.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:32.410
My father told me that people who can't make a living are no longer human.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:37.540
And I'm a much better artist than Horiki.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.550
You are skilled at drawing comics.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.220
Comics?

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.330
So that lady-killer drew this?

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.710
Please don't call him that.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:25.760
You better look out for yourself.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.470
But this is pretty good.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.300
Really?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.720
You can use it.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:35.060
On one condition.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.310
You cannot publish this under his real name.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.280
Very well.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.990
Thank you!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.250
Here it is!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.090
It's not much, but...

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.680
I never thought it would sell...

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.220
The editors all enjoyed it.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:17.230
People actually like it...

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.850
Don't question yourself.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.850
It's a very pleasant comic.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.610
Yes, I can finally make a living now...

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.820
Why don't we visit a hot spring?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.240
My treat.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.990
You don't have to.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.420
But I'm happy for you.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.880
You should draw more.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:09.990
Hey!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.700
Don't come out.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.700
I'm not going to draw you anymore.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.540
I've become a real human now.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.290
Begone.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.710
Daddy, what's wrong?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.170
It's nothing.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:41.100
So you were here after all!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.020
I've been lookin' for ya.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.730
Good afternoon, young lady.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.190
Who's he?

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:49.070
Don't worry.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.450
He's Daddy's friend.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.490
Daddy, huh?

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.910
Taking it easy again?

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:00.040
Society won't allow this.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.790
Society?

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.670
What does that have to do with me?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.630
Hey, don't get all cocky just
because your comic sold well.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.550
What society says goes.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.260
Oh, right.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.760
I know a reporter who's looking for your whereabouts.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.100
Says he wants to interview you.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.640
A lady-killer starts living with a woman,

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.520
and a young girl.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.940
I bet he would be glad to find out where you are.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.860
Hey, you've got cash, right?

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.400
I haven't told them yet.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.790
I don't like him.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.010
Society...

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.080
Society...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:42.310
They don't care whether I choose to live or die.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:44.390
This is society.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.980
I've been waiting to meet you, Prince Charming.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.950
This is the payment for your manuscript.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.910
I gave you a little extra.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.990
Thank you.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:05.000
Don't you want to earn a little more?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.670
You're a painter, right?

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.880
Why don't you paint the truth behind that incident?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.500
That incident?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.510
The one in Kamakura three years ago.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.890
I bet society wants to see the truth.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.470
Society?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.180
Never mind.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.980
We'll talk about this on another date.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.000
<b>Bar
Lupin</b>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.010
Whiskey.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:47.260
Why are you gulping it down?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:52.140
You're too handsome to be drinking like that.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.850
Don't tease me.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:58.150
I'm a hideous monster.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:03.030
All I want to do is to live normally,

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:06.700
but society wants to portray me as a monster.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.580
Sounds complicated.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.910
Give me another.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:18.750
In the United States, there are over seven million unemployed.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:22.300
The demonstrations of unemployed job-seekers continue.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.010
Their government has attempted to control these...

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.390
I'm disgusting.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.740
A pack of Golden Bat.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.950
Ah, okay.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.620
You reek of booze.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.660
Did you start downing a bottle after waking up?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.580
How is my drinking any of your concern?

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.290
You smell unpleasant,
and it's inconsiderate to others.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.460
Forgive me.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.800
Daddy?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.590
Daddy!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:08.760
Shigeko!

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.560
Where have you been, Daddy?

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.230
Forgive me, Shigeko.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.020
Where's Mommy?

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.230
At work!

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.560
I see.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.820
You're my one and only goddess.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.990
Your whiskers hurt.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.200
Ah, sorry.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.830
Are you hungry?

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.240
Let's go out and eat, my goddess.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.620
I'm not a goddess.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.420
The gods live in the sky.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.750
Oh, right.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:47.680
Is it true that the gods will make any of your wishes come true?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.090
I think so.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.350
I'd like a real daddy.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:57.850
Daddy, did you kill a lady?

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.270
The grannies in the neighborhood talked about you.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.620
Daddy!?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:25.050
This is society.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.800
<b>Bar
Lupin</b>

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.770
Horiki?

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.310
Hey, did you stay out all night?

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:45.320
Did you get older while I wasn't looking?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:46.820
What do you want?

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.780
Don't give me that.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.280
I heard your father collapsed.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:15:00.120
That flounder gave this to me.
It's from your older brother in Tsugaru.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.040
He's telling you to go home.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.790
You should get ready to go...

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.130
I can't go back.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:13.800
I can't return until I've gained enough fame as an artist, in order to shock my father.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.560
All you can do is draw second-rate comics.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.350
We should go drinking.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.360
I know a place that's open right now.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.990
Really?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.110
You should go back home!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.570
You have to see your father!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.580
Are you going to run away?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.500
Didn't you say I'm fine as I am?

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.830
But...

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.250
See you later!

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:14.910
Why does Daddy keep drinking?

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:18.580
He's not doing it because he likes to.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.580
He's too good for that.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.970
Are you going to run away again?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.730
Shizuko...

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.600
Father...

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.020
Everyone...

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:32.190
It is my own fault that I am weak!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.360
Forgive me!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.490
Forgive me for existing!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.670
It's you.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.550
Oh, you...

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.920
You must be hammered.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.550
Are you crying?

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:58.630
No.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:02.470
Do you know who I am?

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.140
Are you an alcoholic?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:07.690
No, I'm a monster.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.100
You don't look like one.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.650
Won't you listen to my story?

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:25.910
I killed a woman four years ago...

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:31.750
I don't deserve to live as a human.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:36.760
Liar.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.720
You don't look like that at all.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.760
But it's true.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:51.770
I pushed her off the cliff.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:19:01.160
If I'm reborn, I'd like to live more like a human.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.120
Come right after me, okay?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:04.240
Okay.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.540
Hurry up and push me.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.380
I'd feel lonely if you went first.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:15.400
The sleeping pills didn't work because I threw up...

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.690
That's why I survived.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.150
Pitiful...

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.070
You made that up.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.580
You're very mistaken if you really think that happened.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.540
You won't fool me.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:36.170
The ladies at the store said you're a comic artist.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.750
And that you're very good at making up stories.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:44.090
But society says that I murdered her...

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.010
Society does?

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:50.010
Society is just a group of people.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:54.560
A group of people...?

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:58.810
But there are people like me who don't believe everything society tells us.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:04.200
You should leave before you catch a cold.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:10.580
And you should cut back on the drinking.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.910
Good night.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.860
<b>Bar
Lupin</b>

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:47.360
What's wrong?

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.410
I broke up with her.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.870
Do you want to stay on the second floor?

00:21:54.830 --> 00:22:00.630
Why are women all so kind to me?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:08.300
Because the world isn't kind to women.

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:11.760
TOBACCO

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:30.050
New World
Episode Four
No Longer Human
Next Time
